# REMOVED (task 2.6): EasingFunctionsDemo 25 + KeyframeAnimationDemo 22 +
#           AnimPropertiesDemo 16 + MotionDemo 14 + MotionTriggersDemo 5 +
#           ElementRefDemo 3 — the `_M` class: the motion table was
#           re-allocated inside the component function on every render, so
#           every `_M["x"]` use site was a fresh object identity. `_M` is now
#           emitted at module scope (motion defs are compile-time constants;
#           store-referencing motions keep the in-function table until 2.10).
#           Timer 1 + StatsDashboard 1 — the @unmount cleanup class: cleanup
#           reads now enter the deps array (`}, [count]);` — stale-closure
#           fix, final count correct).
