# REMOVED (task 2.11): the 17 unused-identifier + 10 ES5-var entries
# (#70/#69) — audit greps on this file expect 0 hits for the rule ids:
#   - `_i`/`_data` map/match bindings: the harness eslint config now honors
#     the codegen's `_`-prefix convention (argsIgnorePattern "^_"); the
#     match emitter skips destructures with no used bindings entirely
#   - velocity (7) / playAll (3) / parseScrollTrigger (1): the emitters
#     prune unconsumed motion machinery — the drag-velocity tracker was
#     removed (its value had no consumer), the scroll parser is emitted only
#     in the string-config branch, and write-only signals (value never
#     consumed) get no state hook with their mutations DCE'd
#   - TypedSlotPanel ReactNode: stale generated files deleted (no source
#     produces them — the compiler never cleans the output dir)
#   - useDesignTokens.ts: the React copy of the shared sanitizer is now
#     emitted with `let` (the shared ES5 source stays ES5 for OmniView)
